OL,3,AUS preparing to unveil plan for new    
OL,4,Atariffs on global trading partners     
OL,6,FThe US is preparing to announce plans  
OL,7,Ffor new tariffs on several countries as
OL,8,Fearly as Wednesday, the BBC            
OL,9,Funderstands.                           
OL,11,FThe new import taxes would hit many of 
OL,12,FAmerica's biggest trading partners,    
OL,13,Fwith China, the European Union and     
OL,14,FJapan among at least 14 jurisdictions  
OL,15,Faffected.                              
OL,17,FThe move comes after the White House's 
OL,18,Fso-called "Section 301" investigation. 
OL,19,FIt was launched in March after the US  
OL,20,FSupreme Court ruled that President     
OL,21,FDonald Trump's Liberation Day tariffs  
OL,22,Fwere illegal.                          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
