OL,3,AUS preparing to unveil plan for new    
OL,4,Atariffs on global trading partners     
OL,6,FTrump has made tariffs a signature     
OL,7,Fpolicy of his presidency, arguing that 
OL,8,Fthey will help boost American          
OL,9,Fmanufacturing and create jobs.         
